---
layout: changelog
title: "Choose a project config file per environment in the Appwrite CLI"
date: 2026-09-28
cover: /images/changelog/2026-09-28.avif
tags: cli
---

Appwrite CLI 28.1.0 adds a `--config-file` flag, so one repository can keep a separate config for each environment, such as staging and production.

```sh
appwrite push --config-file appwrite.config.prod.json
```

You can also set `APPWRITE_CONFIG_FILE` once for a shell session or CI job.

